WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.854
How should India deal with

2
00:00:01.854 --> 00:00:03.526
its tribal communities?

3
00:00:03.526 --> 00:00:06.026
Three answers have been argued.

4
00:00:06.361 --> 00:00:08.414
Verrier Elwin first argued for

5
00:00:08.414 --> 00:00:10.689
protection, close to isolation.

6
00:00:10.689 --> 00:00:13.173
Ghurye called tribes backward Hindus,

7
00:00:13.173 --> 00:00:14.667
to be assimilated.

8
00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:16.394
Nehru chose integration,

9
00:00:16.394 --> 00:00:18.058
without imposing.

10
00:00:18.405 --> 00:00:20.997
His first principle: people should

11
00:00:20.997 --> 00:00:22.629
develop along the lines of

12
00:00:22.629 --> 00:00:24.219
their own genius.

13
00:00:24.902 --> 00:00:27.191
The Fifth and Sixth Schedules

14
00:00:27.191 --> 00:00:29.509
give special protection to tribal

15
00:00:29.509 --> 00:00:30.488
areas.

16
00:00:30.821 --> 00:00:32.092
Your turn.

17
00:00:32.092 --> 00:00:33.719
Who said this?
